cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the accompanying article and this repository."
type: software
title: "SynthWound: an analytic ground-truth benchmark and attribution framework for photographic wound area measurement"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a synthetic wound benchmark with analytically
  known curved-surface area, an error-attribution protocol that relates
  two-dimensional outline quality to area error, and a compact single-photograph
  wound-area measurement pipeline used as an end-to-end validation carrier.
